y yelling and pointing, with a second woman looking shocked, juxtaposed with a white cat sitting at a dining table looking unimpressed by a salad. This template is ideal for illustrating situations where one party has an over-the-top reaction to something the other party views with calm indifference, disbelief, or mild annoyance.", "source": "vision", "embedding": [-0.03913628, 0.018913075, 0.0062785605, -0.07711921, -0.0025626242, -0.007625837, -0.024285717, 0.013329862, -0.005136098, 0.014540257, -0.0144821005, -0.030517427, 0.007348527, 0.0033529154, 0.11773023, 0.0030799324, 0.001059608, 0.0007340826, 0.018515116, -0.04925176, 0.015642438, 0.008768322, 0.03075613, -0.0005339328, 0.0036001876, 0.014308932, 0.002657312, 0.0027809346, 0.01917101, 0.00038649348, -0.010344678, 0.022277102, -0.0020237956, -0.00080726465, -0.005942753, -0.0031498377, -0.011838292, 0.0032871286, -0.00095061236, 0.03397105, -0.015322617, 0.015703075, -0.017124811, -0.0065338183, 0.0056417915, 0.017164746, 0.01345346, -0.018763512, -0.008126777, 0.018262897, -0.010944991, 0.022470448, 0.0007365956, -0.15839557, -0.00220269, -0.013961866, -0.012458524, -0.024699654, 0.01959699, -0.026332788, -0.0149892485, 0.03631565, 0.002204007, -0.042384043, 0.007830599, -0.018378176, -0.0028649066, 0.0010804299, -0.024240257, -0.019016901, -0.0071517406, -0.005129265, -0.01014925, -0.0014769002, 0.024877345, -0.007180604, 0.0036201603, 0.006014207, 0.002821445, 0.03403154, 0.001216592, 0.0030306077, -0.0030496235, -0.011085161, -0.02019388, 0.0041518295, -0.016187033, -0.023155414, -0.016704138, -0.011808012, -0.015335543, -0.0024326255, 0.017295593, -0.0072090034, 0.0210431, -0.018994937, -0.0049506733, 0.018910216, -0.01746847, -0.0029111744, -0.03083831, -0.007839715, -0.019665409, -0.00093892065, -0.006205455, -0.0034643041, 0.010429661, -0.017025055, -0.023158928, 0.0086453445, 0.0051915725, 0.015273498, 0.0019670308, 0.015510287, 0.0015105342, -0.190232, -0.0048574046, 0.0139374165, -0.0022246148